{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "A group cannot queue a wide battleground bracket across a bracket boundary",
  "contract": "With the default wide brackets, a group of a level 29 and a level 30 Alliance player is refused when its leader queues it for Warsong Gulch, because the members fall in the 10-29 and 30-49 brackets. Neither member is queued or enters the battleground. A Horde group of a level 30 and a level 49 player, who share the 30-49 bracket although stock brackets would split them, is queued as a group. Meanwhile a lone level 29 Horde player who queues at the same time is queued normally and, with no Alliance player in its bracket, is not invited.",
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
